  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Finely chop the **brown onion**. Destem the **silverbeet** and finely chop leaves. Drain and rinse the **lentils**. Pick the **parsley** leaves. Whisk the **egg** in a small bowl using a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/58c7be01d56afa5a610c57d2-0-0-aaa5be6f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a **drizzle** of **olive oil** in a large frying pan over a medium-high heat. Add the **brown onion (use suggested amount)** and cook for **4-5 minutes**, or until softened. Add the **Middle Eastern spice blend** and cook for **1 minute**, or until fragrant. Add the **silverbeet** and cook for **1 minute**, or until wilted. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/58c7be01d56afa5a610c57d2-1-0-884c40fd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, add the **lentils** and mash using a potato masher or fork until softened. **TIP:** Keep the lentils a little chunky if you prefer. Add the **silverbeet mixture**, **parsley**, whisked **egg**, **fine breadcrumbs** and **salt (use suggested amount). Crumble in **3/4** of the **fetta** and season with a **pinch** of **pepper**.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/58c7be01d56afa5a610c57d2-2-0-42629fd0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape the **lentil-fetta mixture** into small patties (**6 for 2 people/ 12 for 4 people**) and lightly dust in **plain flour**. **TIP:** Dusting the patties in plain flour helps them stay together and brown nicely when cooked. Set aside on a plate. Return the pan to a medium-high heat. Add a **drizzle** of **olive oil** and **1/2** of the **lentil-fetta patties** and cook for **4-5 minutes**, turning halfway, until golden and cooked through. Set aside on a plate and cover with foil to keep warm. Repeat with the remaining patties.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/58c7be01d56afa5a610c57d2-3-0-9131315c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dice the **Roma tomato**. In a medium bowl, toss the **mizuana mixed leaves**, the tomato and the **remaining fetta** with **olive oil (1 tbs for 2 people/ 2 tbs for 4 people)** and the **balsamic vinegar**. Season to taste with a **pinch** of **salt** and **pepper** and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/58c7be01d56afa5a610c57d2-4-0-0147a249.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the mizuana salad and the Middle Eastern lentil-fetta patties between plates. Serve with a dollop of **Greek yoghurt**.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/step/58c7be01d56afa5a610c57d2-5-0-efbb1f25.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
